	<section_number>60.2-601</section_number>
	<catch_line>Payment of benefits</catch_line>
	<text>
		All benefits shall be paid through public employment offices, in accordance with such regulations as the Commission may prescribe.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 60-41; 1968, c. 738, § 60.1-46; 1986, c. 480.</history>
